  "classified_by": "meaning, per table",
  "excluded_count": 8,
  "excluded_tables": [
    {
      "detail": "email is a real address and subject is the provider subject. Fifteen gates have kept both out of logs, artifacts and terminals; a backup is not the place to put them back.",
      "exclusion_reason": "carries_the_two_values_this_campaign_protects",
      "included": false,
      "table": "nf_identities"
    },
    {
      "detail": "state_hash, pkce_verifier_hash, pkce_verifier_encrypted and code_challenge. No organization_id either, so it is unscopeable as well as unsafe.",
      "exclusion_reason": "oauth_state_and_pkce_verifier",
      "included": false,
      "table": "nf_auth_redirect_states"
    },
    {
      "detail": "no organization_id, so an export could not be scoped",
      "exclusion_reason": "auth_flow_evidence_without_an_org_partition",
      "included": false,
      "table": "nf_auth_validation_events"
    },
    {
      "detail": "includes the real organization. A restore target must already have the organization row; recreating it from a backup would be how the real org arrives somewhere it was never authorized.",
      "exclusion_reason": "a_restore_precondition_not_a_payload",
      "included": false,
      "table": "organizations"
    },
    {
      "detail": "recorded as export metadata and compared on restore",
      "exclusion_reason": "schema_state_not_data",
      "included": false,
      "table": "alembic_version"
    },
    {
      "detail": "NOT because a column is called `state` - that column holds 'active', a row lifecycle state. It is excluded because a membership joins an identity to an organization, and identities are excluded, so restoring memberships would produce rows pointing at people the backup does not contain.",
      "exclusion_reason": "membership_is_identity_adjacent",
      "included": false,
      "table": "nf_org_memberships"
    },
    {
      "detail": "no organization_id; and a restore must contact no source",
      "exclusion_reason": "source_response_evidence",
      "included": false,
      "table": "nf_raw_source_payloads"
    },
    {
      "detail": "no organization_id, so an export could not be scoped",
      "exclusion_reason": "no_org_partition",
      "included": false,
      "table": "nf_evidence_intake_records"
    }
  ],
